search/AI in Math/RL/2402.03300.md\nResearch/AI in Math/RL/2312.08935.md\nResearch/AI in Math/RL/2305.20050.md\nResearch/AI in Math/RL/2005.01917.md\nResearch/AI in Math/RL/1805.07563.md\nArchitecture/Mixer/Documentation/Overview/B25-reductions-ledger-2026-06-26.md\nArchitecture/Mixer/Documentation/Overview/B25-infiniteness-obstruction-frontier-2026-08-01.md\nAgents/Kourovka/bus/inbox/MathExpert/2026-08-12T170553Z__Problem-21.31__REPORT__order-252-test-vacuous.md\nAgents/Kourovka/bus/inbox/MathExpert/2026-08-12T1703Z__Problem-19.30__QUESTION__counterexample-targets.md\nAgents/Kourovka/bus/inbox/MathExpert/2026-08-12T154803Z__Lead__REQUEST__review-21.90-after-validator.md\nAgents/Kourovka/bus/inbox/MathExpert/2026-08-12T0323Z__Problem-16.4__QUESTION__best-current-reduction.md\nArchitecture/Mixer/Documentation/Math Validation/2026-08-09-b25-stage2-overlap-verdict.md\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
